#. ja: マンドラクイーン
#. de: Königin Mandragora
#. fr: Reine mandragore
#. column 2: Mandragora Queens
#. column 8: Though wed to the Tomato King in a move to strengthen the bond of houses Tomato and Mandragora, the queen longs to steal away with her one true love─the Eggplant Knight. What will become of this forbidden romance!? Use item to acquire the Mandragora Queen minion and find out!
#. column 9: Mandragora Queen
msgctxt "Item:8196:0:0"
msgid "Mandragora Queen"
msgstr "Королева Мандрагора"

