#. ja: スノーマン
#. de: Schneemann
#. fr: bonhomme de neige
#. column 2: snowmen
#. column 8: Garlean scholars have conducted extensive studies on the subject of why Eorzean snowmen are constructed of only two balls of snow rather than three─the number of choice throughout Ilsabard. The prevailing theory is that extensive studies should not have been conducted on said subject.
#. column 9: Snowman
msgctxt "Item:8826:0:0"
msgid "snowman"
msgstr "снеговик"

#. de: Schneemänner
#. fr: bonhommes de neige
#. column 0: snowman
#. column 8: Garlean scholars have conducted extensive studies on the subject of why Eorzean snowmen are constructed of only two balls of snow rather than three─the number of choice throughout Ilsabard. The prevailing theory is that extensive studies should not have been conducted on said subject.
#. column 9: Snowman
msgctxt "Item:8826:0:2"
msgid "snowmen"
msgstr "снеговики"

#. ja: 星芒祭の時期に作る雪だるま
#. de: Garleische Gelehrte haben umfangreiche Studien durchgeführt, um herauszufinden, warum Schneemänner in Eorzea aus zwei Schneebällen bestehen statt aus dreien - wie es in Ilsabard der Fall ist. Die vorherrschende Meinung ist, dass man lieber keine Zeit auf derartige Studien verschwenden sollte.
#. fr: Ce personnage fait de neige est un des jeux préférés des enfants pendant la fête des étoiles.
#. column 0: snowman
#. column 2: snowmen
#. column 9: Snowman
msgctxt "Item:8826:0:8"
msgid "Garlean scholars have conducted extensive studies on the subject of why Eorzean snowmen are constructed of only two balls of snow rather than three─the number of choice throughout Ilsabard. The prevailing theory is that extensive studies should not have been conducted on said subject."
msgstr "Гарлеанские учёные провели немало исследований, пытаясь выяснить, почему эорзейские снеговики состоят всего из двух снежных шаров, а не из трёх, как принято во всём Илсабарде. Главный вывод учёных: не стоило тратить столько времени на эти исследования."

